WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,071 --> 00:00:03,013
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,063 --> 00:00:05,043
This is Episode 53.

3
00:00:05,093 --> 00:00:06,812
Maya's line is long.

4
00:00:06,862 --> 00:00:08,507
She pours slowly.

5
00:00:08,557 --> 00:00:09,596
Uh oh.

6
00:00:09,646 --> 00:00:11,459
Here comes the watchtower!

7
00:00:11,509 --> 00:00:12,939
The tall tower.

8
00:00:12,989 --> 00:00:14,625
Its needle goes red.

9
00:00:14,675 --> 00:00:15,816
Ding ding!

10
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:17,055
Too busy.

11
00:00:17,105 --> 00:00:18,433
The trail book.

12
00:00:18,483 --> 00:00:20,565
Every visit leaves a footprint.

13
00:00:20,615 --> 00:00:21,729
Who came.

14
00:00:21,779 --> 00:00:22,902
In order.

15
00:00:22,952 --> 00:00:24,243
The blueprint.

16
00:00:24,293 --> 00:00:25,919
The roof looks wrong.

17
00:00:25,969 --> 00:00:27,186
Red glow!

18
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:28,331
Fix it.

19
00:00:28,381 --> 00:00:29,802
The glow string.

20
00:00:29,852 --> 00:00:31,161
Pitcher to cup.

21
00:00:31,211 --> 00:00:32,465
Orange here.

22
00:00:32,515 --> 00:00:33,843
Slow spot!

23
00:00:33,893 --> 00:00:35,892
Maya grabs a bigger pitcher.

24
00:00:35,942 --> 00:00:37,242
Yellow again.

25
00:00:37,292 --> 00:00:38,563
Fast again.

26
00:00:38,613 --> 00:00:40,054
The line moves.

27
00:00:40,104 --> 00:00:41,581
The bell stops.

28
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:43,014
Four helpers.

29
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:44,328
One tower.

30
00:00:44,378 --> 00:00:45,370
Watch.

31
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,516
Remember.

32
00:00:46,566 --> 00:00:47,614
Compare.

33
00:00:47,664 --> 00:00:48,695
Trace.

34
00:00:48,745 --> 00:00:50,454
That is the watchtower.

35
00:00:50,504 --> 00:00:54,663
Now you know CloudWatch, CloudTrail, Config, and X-Ray!

36
00:00:54,713 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
